DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
44979::$$$message_0399_0000_0000$$$::"Oh, it's you, Rider."::
44980::$$$message_0399_0000_0001$$$::"Ah, Saber! What a coincidence...[wvl canskip=false time=100][hffgchg2 chara=ライダー4th face=真剣 pos=right time=300 twno=1] Or perhaps not."::
44981::$$$message_0399_0000_0002$$$::"Hey, it's the little boy."::
44982::$$$message_0399_0000_0003$$$::"..."::
44983::$$$message_0399_0000_0004$$$::"What's wrong?"::
44984::$$$message_0399_0000_0005$$$::"...Are you talking about me?"::
44985::$$$message_0399_0000_0006$$$::"Well, I clearly don't mean Rider."::
44986::$$$message_0399_0000_0007$$$::"That's awfully rude! I have a name, you know! It's Waver Velvet!"::
44987::$$$message_0399_0000_0008$$$::"Aww, you're so adorable. Illya is cute, but I would've liked a son, too..."::
44988::$$$message_0399_0000_0009$$$::"Nnrrrgh..."::
44989::$$$message_0399_0000_0010$$$::"Don't let your guard down, Iri."::
44990::$$$message_0399_0000_0011$$$::"Kiritsugu?"::
44991::$$$message_0399_0000_0012$$$::"Contrary to appearances, Rider's Master is a cautious and bold..."::
44992::$$$message_0399_0000_0013$$$::"...man?[wvl canskip=false time=300] You are a man, right?"::
44993::$$$message_0399_0000_0014$$$::"[font italic=true]How is that even a question!?[font italic=false] Yes, I am one hundred percent male!"::
44994::$$$message_0399_0000_0015$$$::"See, boy? It isn't good to be short. You need to put on another thirty-odd centimeters... And get some meat on those bones, as well."::
44995::$$$message_0399_0000_0016$$$::"Grrrrrrr..."::
44996::$$$message_0399_0000_0017$$$::"No, Rider! Then he won't be cute anymore!"::
44997::$$$message_0399_0000_0018$$$::"The boy doesn't need to be lovable. He needs to train his body to be as hard as steel!"::
44998::$$$message_0399_0000_0019$$$::"That would be such a waste! Little Waver should stay adorable forever! [wvl canskip=false time=100][hffgchg2 chara=アイリ face=喜 pos=left time=400 twno=1]Don't you think so, Saber!?"::
44999::$$$message_0399_0000_0020$$$::"Huh? Uh, um, I don't really care..."::
45000::$$$message_0399_0000_0021$$$::"Personally, I think he should change his hairstyle."::
45001::$$$message_0399_0000_0022$$$::"Eh?"::
45002::$$$message_0399_0000_0023$$$::"...I'm afraid I might mistake you for my assistant Maiya."::
45003::$$$message_0399_0000_0024$$$::"Ah..."::
45004::$$$message_0399_0000_0025$$$::"ARRRGH! I'VE HAD IT! You all think you can just say whatever you want about me!?"::
45005::$$$message_0399_0000_0026$$$::"Let's fight! Throw your cards down!"::
45006::$$$message_0399_0000_0027$$$::"I feel bad for him, even if he is our enemy..."::

